sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DEV as Desarrollador
    participant GH as GitHub (repo de 200)
    participant GHA as GitHub Actions
    participant SQ as SonarQube (web)
    participant CE as Compute Engine<br/>1 worker, cola FIFO
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    DEV->>GH: merge a main
    GH->>GHA: push a main (NO pull_request)
    Note over GHA: concurrency: sonar-${{ github.repository }}<br/>cancel-in-progress: true
    GHA->>GHA: build + tests + cobertura
    GHA->>SQ: sonarqube-scan-action · POST /api/ce/submit
    SQ->>CE: encola la tarea
    Note over CE: con 200 proyectos, en horas punta<br/>la cola es el cuello de botella
    CE->>DB: procesa el informe, persiste
    CE->>SQ: indexa en ES
    GHA->>SQ: espera quality gate (timeout 300 s)
    SQ-->>GHA: OK / ERROR
    GHA-->>GH: check verde / rojo en el commit de main
